Source: kaos-droidian-integration
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Kaos Project <kaos@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 13),
               debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: kaos-droidian-integration
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         phosh-config-hwcomposer,
         halium-wrappers
Description: Kaos project-wide integration for Droidian
 This package contains device-agnostic configuration files and
 integration scripts used by the Kaos/HybridOS ROM when booting
 Droidian in a Halium-style LXC container.  It extends the upstream
 phosh-config-hwcomposer and halium-wrappers packages with overrides
 required by this project's system-as-root (SAR) partition layout and
 shared Android system image.
